  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "b1b65ab107e14*****3dbb900f6c1fe0",
      "help_en": "The transcoding task ID. You can obtain the ID by using one of the following methods:\nCall the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/68570.html operation to submit a transcoding task. The value of TranscodeTaskId in the response is the transcoding task ID.\nCall the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/109120.html operation. The value of TranscodeTaskId in the response is the transcoding task ID",
      "help_zh": "转码任务ID，可通过以下方式获取：\n通过https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/68570.html接口发起转码任务时，为返回参数TranscodeTaskId的值。\n通过https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/109120.html接口查询，为请求后返回参数TranscodeTaskId的值",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "transcode_task_id",
      "options": [
        "--transcode-task-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "TranscodeTaskId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "86c1925fba0****,7afb201e7fa****,2cc4997378****",
      "help_en": "The transcoding job IDs. You can specify a maximum of 10 IDs. Separate multiple IDs with commas (,). You can obtain the IDs by using the following method:\nCall the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/68570.html operation to submit a transcoding task. The value of JobId in the response is the transcoding job ID",
      "help_zh": "转码作业ID，最多支持10个ID，多个ID之间使用半角逗号（,）分隔。可通过以下方式获取：\n通过https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/68570.html接口发起转码任务时，为返回参数JobId的值",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "job_ids",
      "options": [
        "--job-ids"
      ],
      "raw_name": "JobIds",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
